    "role": "ai",
    "content": "I've pulled the plant's hourly consumption for 18 March 2026 (the 24 local hours of that day). The figures come from the site meter alone, which already includes every department, line and machine below it. They're in kWh and rounded to 3 decimals.\n\nUse was lowest from midnight to 06:00, bottoming out at about 352 kWh between 05:00 and 06:00. It jumped from 06:00 and peaked at about 1,766 kWh between 08:00 and 09:00. It stayed between about 1,190 and 1,620 kWh until 22:00, then fell back to around 640\u2013730 kWh.\n\nbucket_start,value\n2026-03-18T00:00:00+01:00,697.994\n2026-03-18T01:00:00+01:00,631.176\n2026-03-18T02:00:00+01:00,608.433\n2026-03-18T03:00:00+01:00,624.353\n2026-03-18T04:00:00+01:00,558.757\n2026-03-18T05:00:00+01:00,352.364\n2026-03-18T06:00:00+01:00,1170.043\n2026-03-18T07:00:00+01:00,1592.926\n2026-03-18T08:00:00+01:00,1765.532\n2026-03-18T09:00:00+01:00,1705.712\n2026-03-18T10:00:00+01:00,1488.861\n2026-03-18T11:00:00+01:00,1413.543\n2026-03-18T12:00:00+01:00,1522.448\n2026-03-18T13:00:00+01:00,1410.678\n2026-03-18T14:00:00+01:00,1546.045\n2026-03-18T15:00:00+01:00,1620.068\n2026-03-18T16:00:00+01:00,1382.286\n2026-03-18T17:00:00+01:00,1313.728\n2026-03-18T18:00:00+01:00,1370.492\n2026-03-18T19:00:00+01:00,1193.021\n2026-03-18T20:00:00+01:00,1338.547\n2026-03-18T21:00:00+01:00,1462.822\n2026-03-18T22:00:00+01:00,725.683\n2026-03-18T23:00:00+01:00,640.719",
